        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cibus Odyssey is a thrilling <strong>party board game in VR</strong> where strategy meets action. Compete on the main map by collecting two treasures or defeating your rivals three times. Use your sled's map and camera to plan your moves and make the most of your items to gain the upper hand. Between rounds, dive into fast-paced mini-games to earn valuable resources — cash, ammo, and power-ups — all of which give you a competitive edge in the main game. Perform well, and you might just become the 'chosen one' who saves the continent of Cibus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cibus Odyssey</strong> follows the classic formula of party board games.<br>Players will travel between the main map and a variety of mini-games, all striving for ultimate victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you can do on the Main Map:</strong><br>The main map is the core battleground where victory is decided.<br>Players roll dice, use items, check the map and camera angles, and develop strategic plans to outsmart their opponents.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory Conditions in Frozen Bingsu(Achieve either condition, and you'll claim victory!):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 2 treasures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat opponents 3 times</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory Conditions in Panem(Achieve either condition, and you'll claim victory!):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete Miasma Detection 3 times </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat opponents 3 times</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you can do in Mini-Games:</strong><br><i>Cibus Odyssey</i> features a wide array of mini-games that test your reflexes, brainpower, and luck.<br>Place high in these mini-games to earn valuable rewards!<br>Top-ranking players will receive generous amounts of money, items, and bullets—key advantages that can turn the tide on the main map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More main maps and mini-games will be added to <i>Cibus Odyssey</i> over time.<br>Embark on your journey to victory now!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cibus Odyssey is a thrilling <strong>party board game in VR</strong> where strategy meets action. Compete on the main map by collecting two treasures or defeating your rivals three times. Use your sled's map and camera to plan your moves and make the most of your items to gain the upper hand. Between rounds, dive into fast-paced mini-games to earn valuable resources — cash, ammo, and power-ups — all of which give you a competitive edge in the main game. Perform well, and you might just become the 'chosen one' who saves the continent of Cibus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cibus Odyssey</strong> follows the classic formula of party board games.<br>Players will travel between the main map and a variety of mini-games, all striving for ultimate victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you can do on the Main Map:</strong><br>The main map is the core battleground where victory is decided.<br>Players roll dice, use items, check the map and camera angles, and develop strategic plans to outsmart their opponents.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory Conditions in Frozen Bingsu(Achieve either condition, and you'll claim victory!):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 2 treasures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat opponents 3 times</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory Conditions in Panem(Achieve either condition, and you'll claim victory!):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete Miasma Detection 3 times </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat opponents 3 times</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you can do in Mini-Games:</strong><br><i>Cibus Odyssey</i> features a wide array of mini-games that test your reflexes, brainpower, and luck.<br>Place high in these mini-games to earn valuable rewards!<br>Top-ranking players will receive generous amounts of money, items, and bullets—key advantages that can turn the tide on the main map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More main maps and mini-games will be added to <i>Cibus Odyssey</i> over time.<br>Embark on your journey to victory now!</p>",
        "short_description": "Cibus Odyssey is VR party board game. You are no longer just a player — you become the game piece itself. Move, use items, and compete in mini-games, all from a fully immersive first-person perspective. Win mini-games, dominate the board, and prove you’re the 'Chosen One' to save Cibus.",
